WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:18,730
Since taking your suggested supplements of burberry apricot v17 and osteo-k, do any of these have the potential of causing nausea?

00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:29,200
Yes, for sure. The v17, the apricot power, probably most likely, component of causing nausea.

00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:34,580
The burberry probably not, osteo-k, probably not.

00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:51,580
So the osteo-k is a little bit of calcium, not too much calcium, very high content of the vitamin K and in the form of MK4, which is what you want to get to calcium to the bone.

00:00:51,580 --> 00:01:04,580
Probably the v17, so I would just take it with food, all three of these can be taken with food, so I would get some food in your tummy, that was probably what's going on.

